                                                "ingredientes":  "AQUA, CYCLOPENTASILOXANE, PROPYLENE GLYCOL, ISODODECANE, DIMETHICONE, TRIMETHYLSILOXYSILICATE, CETYL PEG/PPG -10/1 DIMETHICONE , POLYGLYCERYL -3 DIISOSTEARATE, MAGNESIUM STEARATE, MAGNESIUM SULFATE, METHYLPARABEN (0.3%), TOCOPHEROL, SODIUM HYALURONATE, PARFUM, PUEDE CONTENER CI 77891, CI 77499, CI 77491.",
